{"id":"C3c5f15493ae9967464ce","zh":"车体加速度","en":"car body acceleration","domain":"动力响应","definition_zh":"车辆车体的加速度响应。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":"保留测点、方向及统计口径；不能与轮对、转向架或钢轨加速度互换。car body 不省略成 car。","scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C3c5f15493ae9967464ce","zh":"车体加速度","en":"car body acceleration","domain":"动力响应","group_id":"H685d036f4520639db848","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"动力响应 · 徐磊等（2018）"},{"id":"Cf3d57c1bb9b989e817fc","zh":"车体加速度","en":"car body acceleration","domain":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学","group_id":"H685d036f4520639db848","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"车辆轨道基础结构动力学 · Xu等（2022）"}],"designations":[{"id":"De68f651af0eae28daf93","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"车体加速度"},{"id":"D01787d2bbe266e88e251","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"car body acceleration"},{"id":"D08c5f895ca7cec9241da","language":"en","role":"variant","text":"car body accelerations"}],"sources":{"P115":{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.19818/j.cnki.1671-1637.2018.03.006","journal_citation":"交通运输工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-track-irregularity-probabilistic-model"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7c345d3561f0397b7da4","source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"Under the presented computational condition, the wheel-rail forces and car body accelerations are 38-152kN and-0.042g-0.043g, respectively, and are respectively less than the limits of wheel-rail forces(170kN)and car body accelerations(0.25g)in Code for High Speed Railway Design(TB 10621—2014).","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S0bfc16f670c1bddffed0","source_id":"P115","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"计算结果表明: 以2种模型生成的轨道随机不平顺为激振源,获得的车辆-轨道系统动力响应分布熵差异小于2%, 2种模型均能准确表达不平顺激扰特性;为保证模拟与实测不平顺的概率密度分布一致,采用随机模型和概率模型分别需要生成131和33个随机样本,概率模型具有更高的分析效率;在给定计算工况下,轮轨力和车体加速度的幅值分别为38~152kN和-0.042g~0.043g(g为重力加速度), 均未超过《高速铁路设计规范》(TB 10621—2014)中的限值(轮轨力为170kN,车体加速度为 0.25g),表明此高速铁路轨道不平顺状态较优,行车安全性和舒适性可以得到保证。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sb57bb55912ee15700f16","source_id":"P115","page":6,"page_end":7,"language":"zh","text":"显然,对于车辆系统的垂向动力响应指标(轮轨垂向力和车体垂向加速度),概率熵差异在2%以内,表明TISM和TIPM的结果吻合良好;此外,轮轨力和车体加速度的幅值分别为38~152kN和 -0.042g~0.043g,均未超过《高速铁路设计规范》 (TB 10621—2014)中的限值(轮轨力为170kN,车体加速度为0.25g),说明此轨道不平顺状态较好, 行车安全,舒适性可以得到保证。","citations":[{"source_id":"P115","page":6,"page_end":7}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"Cd7e5057709fa3fac18da","target_concept_id":"Cd7e5057709fa3fac18da","target_zh":"车体垂向加速度","target_en":"car body vertical accelerations","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_concept_id":"C6e973ad4445239876e9c","target_zh":"轨道随机不平顺","target_en":"track random irregularities","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb2f3d8a55cf509ac223c","target_concept_id":"Cb2f3d8a55cf509ac223c","target_zh":"轮轨垂向力","target_en":"wheel-rail vertical forces","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C2aac67a67d96243d25ee","target_concept_id":"C2aac67a67d96243d25ee","target_zh":"概率模型","target_en":"probabilistic model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","target_concept_id":"Cf0264deae6244e2cebce","target_zh":"高速铁路","target_en":"high -speed railway","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_concept_id":"Cb68afc34d23ed014371b","target_zh":"动力响应","target_en":"dynamic responses","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C43d601053451614c1162","target_concept_id":"C43d601053451614c1162","target_zh":"轮轨力","target_en":"wheel-rail forces","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P115","title":"轨道不平顺概率模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":